","v":"19AnT02","n":36,"p":111,"s":"Devadūtasuttavaṇṇanā","w":3,"k":["gopanas","vank","viy"]},{"l":"Bākulatthero viyā","g":"thero hi mahāyasassī, tassa puttadhītaro nattupanattakā sukhumasāṭakehi cīvarāni kāretvā rajāpetvā samugge pakkhipitvā pahiṇanti.","v":"19AnT02","n":87,"p":317,"s":"Puttasuttavaṇṇanā","w":2,"k":["bakulather","viy"]},{"l":"Khadiravanamagge sīvalitthero viyā","g":"satthari kira taṁ maggaṁ paṭipanne devatā “amhākaṁ ayyassa sīvalittherassa sakkāraṁ karissāmā”ti cintetvā ekekayojane vihāraṁ kāretvā ekayojanato uddhaṁ gantuṁ adatvā pātova uṭṭhāya dibbāni yāgu-ādīni gahetvā “amhākaṁ ayyo sīvalitthero kahaṁ nisinno”ti vicaranti.","v":"19AnT02","n":87,"p":317,"s":"Puttasuttavaṇṇanā","w":3,"k":["khadiravanamag","sivalither","viy"]},{"l":"Aṭṭhakanāgarasutte ānandatthero viyā","g":"aṭṭhakanāgarako kira gahapati therassa dhammadesanāya pasīditvā pañcasatagghanakaṁ vihāraṁ kāretvā adāsi.","v":"19AnT02","n":87,"p":317,"s":"Puttasuttavaṇṇanā","w":3,"k":["anandather","athakanagarasut","viy"]},{"l":"Pilindavacchatthero viyā","g":"therassa kira iddhānubhāvena pasannā manussā sappi-ādīni bahūni bhesajjāni abhihariṁsu.","v":"19AnT02","n":87,"p":317,"s":"Puttasuttavaṇṇanā","w":2,"k":["pilindavachather","viy"]},{"l":"khīrodakaṁ viya bhūtā","g":", yathā khīrañca udakañca aññamaññaṁ saṁsandati, visuṁ na hoti, ekattaṁ viya upeti, evaṁ sāmaggivasena ekattūpagatacittuppādāti attho.","v":"19AnT02","n":96,"p":193,"s":"Parisāsuttavaṇṇanā","w":3,"k":["bhut","khirodak","viy"],"q":1},{"l":"khanitti viya vipassanā","g":"ca vuttaṁ.","v":"19AnT02","n":195,"p":364,"s":"Vappasuttavaṇṇanā","w":3,"k":["khanit","vipas","viy"],"q":1},{"l":"Mahāsamudde vātakkhittā nāvā viyā","g":"idaṁ paribbhamanaṭṭhānassa mahantadassanatthañceva paribbhamanassa anavaṭṭhitatādassanatthañca upamā.","v":"19AnT02","n":199,"p":382,"s":"Attantapasuttavaṇṇanā","w":4,"k":["mahasamud","nav","vatakhit","viy"]},{"l":"Yante yuttagoṇo viyā","g":"idaṁ pana avasībhāvadassanatthañceva duppamokkhabhāvadassanatthañcāti v